  unitName: Holy Skalmold (EU)
  unitId: 710114
  unitNumber: 7021
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Skalmold, through mischief
    and charm has been blessed by a god of fire, her burning lover. Although she
    has taken flight from her responsibilities as a soul bringer, she does not care
    one bit; the equipment that comes with her divine endowment gives her the power
    she craves.
  summonDesc: Summoned by a mere human?! My power must have diminished.
  fusionDesc: Fusion? Give me more!
  evoDesc: Thank you! I love power! Can I have more? I'll be sweet.
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
